WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.703
President Trump's
ex-National Security Adviser

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.638
is trying to cash in with a
tell-all book after refusing to

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.507
testify in Trump's
impeachment trial.

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:10.176
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:14.013
♪♪

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.682
We all know the president
is a venal, corrupt,

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:17.883
self-serving maniac.

00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:19.385
This much is plain to everyone.

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:22.655
Hell, it was the original title
of this show.

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:24.557
You don't have to peel back
the layers with Trump.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.491
There's one layer.

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:26.793
It's a thick epidermis

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.762
of botox-infused pancake skin

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:32.031
wrapped around a dark howling
void where a soul should be.

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:34.366
Yesterday, for example, he
called in for yet another

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:36.536
televised therapy session
with Sean Hannity,

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.904
where he once again repeated
his insane lie

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:41.474
that the coronavirus pandemic,
which has now killed more

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:43.309
Americans than World War I,

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.977
which is growing in
about 20 states,

00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:47.280
and which is spiking at
alarming levels in places

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.817
like Arizona and Texas, will
just magically disappear.

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:51.951
-It's fading away.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.285
It's going to fade away.

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:57.056
Nobody knew that it was going
to be that contagious.

00:00:57.056 --> 00:01:00.827
Nobody had any idea it was going
to be this kind of contagious

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:02.661
-Honestly at this point,
who's the audience for this?

00:01:02.661 --> 00:01:04.430
I mean, obviously these
two guys will TiVo it

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:06.132
and watch it back later that
night while they talk

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:07.533
on the phone, but who else?

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.602
Mr. President,
you crushed that answer.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.137
Well, you crushed that question.

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:13.773
Not only is this a flagrant
and reckless lie,

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.074
it's not even new.

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:16.942
When you buy the new
Steely Dan album,

00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:18.611
do you really want the
track list to say,

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:21.080
"Reelin' In The Years
Remastered" 12 times?

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:24.183
And full disclosure, if they
were remastered as 12 different

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.519
versions of "Reelin' In The
Years," I guess I'd buy it.

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:29.722
Wait, are Fox News viewers just
Steely Dan fans but for Trump?

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:33.359
Trump has repeated a version of
this same lie dozens of times.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.895
He's like a Big Mouth
Billy Bass of bull[bleep].

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:38.998
-It's going to disappear one
day, it's like a miracle.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:40.299
It will disappear.

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:42.101
-Look, I know Trump's
diehard supporters

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:43.936
will never budge from
supporting him,

00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:45.905
but are they really
sitting there

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:48.107
watching the TV saying,
"He's right.

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:50.609
No one new how
contagious it was.

00:01:50.609 --> 00:01:51.944
My buddy told me you
could only catch it

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:53.713
by licking a toilet seat
under a full moon."

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:55.815
So we all know who Trump is.

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.451
Every tell-all book written
by a former Trump aide

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.119
about their time in
the administration

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:01.154
is the exact same.

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:02.422
Some of the details differ,

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:03.656
but they all say the same thing,

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.357
the most powerful man
in the world

00:02:05.357 --> 00:02:07.059
