00:02:07.059 --> 00:02:09.295
with farina brain who
only cares about himself.

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:11.497
The one exception is
Sean Spicer's book,

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:13.766 line:0%
which I think is called,
"The Beefing?"

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:16.102 line:0%
No, no, wait, it was called
"Tales From A Podium Pud."

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:18.771 line:0%
You know what I think it was,
"Stinky Tailor, Stupid Guy."

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.873 line:0%
And yes, that was a tortured

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:23.576 line:0%
"Tinker, Tailor, Soldier, Spy"
joke that almost worked.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.444 line:0%
You know what,
if you think that joke worked,

00:02:25.444 --> 00:02:27.413 line:0%
why don't you text "one"
to your grandmother.

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:30.116 line:0%
And if you think it didn't work,
text "two" to your grandmother.

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:31.918 line:0%
Either way, I think
your grandmother

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:33.252 line:0%
will be happy to
hear from you.

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:36.322 line:0%
Point is, if you're looking
for Sean Spicer's book,

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.391 line:0%
you can find it at
Barnes &amp; Noble

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:39.993 line:0%
in the "Door Stop" section.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:42.529
Anyway, every tell-all Trump
book confirms again and again

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:44.496
how uniquely cretinous
our president is.

00:02:44.496 --> 00:02:47.066
And they are all equally
pointless.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.802
We don't need tell-all books.
We have a tell-all president.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.203
What he does behind
closed doors,

00:02:51.203 --> 00:02:52.571
he also does behind open doors.

00:02:52.571 --> 00:02:54.206
And windows, into microphones,

00:02:54.206 --> 00:02:55.508
and his executive orders.

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.777
It would only be interesting
if behind closed doors

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:00.079
he was eloquent and curious
and not racist.

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:02.048
Then there would be
some all to tell.

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:04.216
And the same thing is true of
ex-National Security Adviser

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:07.019
John Bolton's new book, except
