00:06:24.816 --> 00:06:28.154
And yes, Bolton's book is also
full of the typically

00:06:28.154 --> 00:06:30.856
embarrassing details you'd
expect to hear about life

00:06:30.856 --> 00:06:31.857
in the Trump White House.

00:06:31.857 --> 00:06:33.025
For example, you might remember

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:36.062
that Trump coined --
coined -- the nickname

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:38.864
"Little Rocket Man"
for Kim Jong-un.

00:06:38.864 --> 00:06:41.933
But then after their summit in
Singapore, Trump pretended the

00:06:41.933 --> 00:06:45.804
name was a compliment and tried
to send Kim a gift.

00:06:45.804 --> 00:06:48.007
"In the months following the
summit, Bolton described Trump's

00:06:48.007 --> 00:06:50.476
inordinate interest in Secretary
of State Mike Pompeo

00:06:50.476 --> 00:06:53.946
delivering an autographed copy
of Elton John's 'Rocket Man'

00:06:53.946 --> 00:06:57.282
on CD to Kim during Pompeo's
follow-up visit to North Korea.

00:06:57.282 --> 00:06:59.652
Trump had used the term
'Little Rocket Man' to criticize

00:06:59.652 --> 00:07:01.554
the North Korean leader but
subsequently tried to convince

00:07:01.554 --> 00:07:04.157
